{"id": "t093-001", "text": "Tiago's dad passed away on Sunday after a long time in the hospice. Tiago sounded exhausted but calm, and said his sister has been doing most of the arrangements. The funeral is at St Mary's on 2 November 2026 at eleven, with a wake at the cricket club afterwards. Remind me to send flowers to his mum before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026 at eleven", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wake at the cricket club", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to his mum", "owner": "r3", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-002", "text": "Spoke to Joanna on the phone. She was made redundant on Friday along with most of her team. She sounded flat but says she's fine. I should check in with her next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joanna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
