{"id": "t093-004", "text": "Kiri and Leon have split up after six years. She told me over lunch and was surprisingly matter-of-fact about it. She's staying in the flat for now and he's gone back to his parents' place in Leeds. They're still sharing their dog Juno, which she admits is a bit awkward.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "matter-of-fact", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "place in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit awkward", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
