{"id": "t093-008", "text": "Gareth is a huge Wrexham fan and has a season ticket. He also mentioned he's been learning Welsh on Duolingo.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wrexham", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Welsh", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-009", "text": "Call Rebecca back about the weekend. She wants to come and visit with the kids around May 14.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call Rebecca back about the weekend", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around May 14", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t093-010", "text": "Caitlin's engagement is off. She didn't want to talk about it much, just said they'd agreed it wasn't right. Must remember not to ask about the venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement is off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "not to ask about the venue", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
