{"id": "t093-012", "text": "Kaito said his redundancy meeting is on Tuesday. He's really anxious about it because they've only just bought the house and his wife is on maternity leave until June 2027. He's been told about a third of the department will go. I'd like to message him on Tuesday evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bought the house", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "on maternity leave", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until June 2027"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-013", "text": "Santiago, or Santi as everyone calls him, is moving back to Valencia in January 2027. Leaving drinks are on the 12th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santi", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Valencia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-014", "text": "Shreya's cat Pickle had to be put to sleep yesterday. She was in bits on the phone. Maybe drop round with some biscuits at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put to sleep", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round with some biscuits", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
