{"id": "t093-025", "text": "Giulia Rossi rang to say the trip to Lisbon in March 2027 is cancelled because her brother Nasser broke his leg skiing in Austria. He's having surgery on Monday and will be in a cast for at least six weeks. She's going to stay with him for a bit. Need to get the deposit back from the apartment people.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia Rossi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke his leg", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the deposit back from the apartment people", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
