{"id": "t093-027", "text": "Rhys's brother died very suddenly in September. Rhys is back at work but clearly struggling. He's not sleeping and has stopped going to five-a-side. He mentioned the inquest is on January 18 and that his mum is dreading it. I must make time to take him out for a pint before then, and maybe ring him on the 18th itself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stopped going to five-a-side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "inquest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 18", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th itself", "anchor": "a2"}]}
