{"id": "t093-032", "text": "Joanna's leaving do is on May 30 at the Crown. She's going freelance after twelve years at the firm and seems genuinely thrilled about it. Her first client is a charity she used to volunteer for. She'd love a decent pair of headphones for the train, apparently, so a few of us might chip in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joanna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent pair of headphones for the train", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t093-033", "text": "Note to self: the boiler service is on 7 November 2026 between eight and twelve. Need to work from home that day.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "boiler service", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 November 2026 between eight and twelve", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "work from home", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-034", "text": "FaceTime with Kiri on Sunday at seven, her time. She's having a hard week after the breakup and just wants company.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "FaceTime", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at seven", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "having a hard week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t093-035", "text": "Leon told me his company is closing the Manchester office at the end of March 2027 and he'll probably be made redundant. He hasn't decided whether to take the package or move to London. Honestly he seems more excited than worried. He's always wanted to try running his own bike repair business, and he's already looking at a unit near the canal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "closing the Manchester office", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanted to try running his own bike repair business", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t093-036", "text": "Dr Khan said Mum's results won't be back until June 10th. Remind me to call the surgery on the 11th if we've heard nothing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Khan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until June 10th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call the surgery", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 11th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-037", "text": "Bumped into Duc and his wife at the station. Their daughter starts university in Glasgow in September, and they're driving her up on 9/14.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "university in Glasgow", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving her up", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/14", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-038", "text": "Drop off the bags at the charity shop and get stamps.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Drop off the bags at the charity shop", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get stamps", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t093-039", "text": "Blessing said thank you for the card. The service for her grandmother was beautiful, and her aunt's staying with them until the new year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "service", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the new year", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-040", "text": "Yusuf's brother Tiago got married in Porto last weekend. Yusuf said the speeches went on for an hour.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got married in Porto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t093-041", "text": "Don't forget to ring Uncle Gareth on 30 October 2026. It's a year since Auntie Pam passed and he'll be on his own.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Uncle Gareth", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 October 2026", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Auntie Pam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t093-042", "text": "Ryan and Heather are both coming to the quiz on Thursday. Book a table for four.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Heather", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiz", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book a table for four", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t093-043", "text": "Rebecca's divorce was finalised on 6/2. She says she feels lighter than she has in years. Her sister Caitlin is taking her to Rome for a long weekend in July to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "divorce", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lighter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long weekend", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-044", "text": "Shreya mentioned she collects vintage Penguin paperbacks. The orange ones especially. Good gift idea for later in the year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vintage Penguin paperbacks", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "later in the year"}]}
{"id": "t093-045", "text": "I'm taking the train to Bristol on 3 December 2026 for the conference. Hotel's booked for two nights.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the train to Bristol", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "conference", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t093-046", "text": "Kaito texted after the meeting. They kept him on but cut his hours to four days. He's relieved but a bit worried about money.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut his hours to four days", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried about money", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t093-047", "text": "Remind me to send Santi the link to that flat in Valencia.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Santi the link to that flat in Valencia", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santi", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t093-048", "text": "Long call with Ming tonight. Her father died in Kunming on October 3rd and she couldn't get a flight in time. She's going over for the hundred-day ceremony in January 2027, and her partner Felix is going with her. She said what helps most is people saying his name rather than avoiding it. Need to check in with her before she flies and maybe send something small for the altar.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "father", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died in Kunming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hundred-day ceremony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "people saying his name rather than avoiding it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she flies", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something small for the altar", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t093-049", "text": "Vanessa is a primary school teacher in Croydon. She has two boys, eight and eleven, who are both obsessed with chess. She runs the after-school chess club on Wednesdays and is trying to get the older one into a junior tournament in the spring. She hates coriander, for what it's worth.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "primary school teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eight and eleven", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs the after-school chess club", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "junior tournament", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates coriander", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t093-050", "text": "Hana's interview at the design studio is on November 4th. She's nervous because it's her first one in five years. Text her good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the design studio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-051", "text": "Need to sort out the spare room before the end of the month. Sell the old desk on Marketplace.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort out the spare room", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Sell the old desk on Marketplace", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t093-052", "text": "Rosa and her sister Laila are clearing out their mum's house on the weekend of 14 November 2026. I offered to help on the Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "clearing out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend of 14 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
