{"id": "t093-054", "text": "Nothing much from the call with Nasser. Mostly football.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-055", "text": "Grandma's ninetieth is on 21 February 2027. Ask Rhys if he's still up for doing the cake.", "spans": [{"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Grandma"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ninetieth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21 February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Rhys if he's still up for doing the cake", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t093-056", "text": "Aurelio's partner Catalina has just been made redundant from the hospital trust. Her last day is 12/19, right before Christmas. Aurelio says she's putting a brave face on it but he's worried. They had planned to go to Mexico in the spring, but that's on hold now. I should invite them both over for dinner sometime in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the hospital trust", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/19", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "right before Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite them both over for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in December", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-057", "text": "Tamar's twins turn three on April 8. She hinted that they'd love a play kitchen.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turn three", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a play kitchen", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
